    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "36 cards are used. Seniority: 6 is the lowest, Ace is the highest. \n\nTrumps
    are always higher. Each player has 6 cards at the beginning. The trump is opened
    to determine the trump suit. \n\nOne player attacks (moves), the other defends.
    The attacker puts down a card, the defender must beat it with a card of the same
    suit, but of a higher value, or a trump. If the defender cannot beat it, he takes
    all the cards. \n\nIf all the cards are beaten, they are discarded. The game
    continues until the cards in the deck and in the hands of the players are exhausted.\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 698da777ce3465d4191d65fd558d9443, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 4933445069101303701, guid: 698da777ce3465d4191d65fd558d9443, type: 2}
